eployment/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#everything-returns-403-or-5xx","content":"Everything returns 403 or 5xx"},"385":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#a-pod-is-not-ready","content":"A pod is not Ready"},"386":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#events-are-not-arriving","content":"Events are not arriving"},"387":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#observability","content":"Observability"},"388":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","content":"Start by locating the failing layer. A Gateway response and an unready pod require different evidence. For rejected issuance or validation results, see PKI troubleshooting; for enrollment, see EST diagnostics."},"389":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#reproduce-a-single-operation","content":"Note the time in UTC, user or principal, resource, endpoint and result. Avoid repeating a destructive action such as revocation or deletion."},"390":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#separate-client-gateway-and-service","content":"Check the HTTP status. A 401 points to authentication; a 403, to authorization; a 404, to route or resource; a 5xx, to the service or a dependency."},"391":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#review-kubernetes-status","content":"Locate unready pods, restarts, recent events and the state of the release."},"392":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#query-the-affected-service","content":"Review its /health endpoint and its logs in the same time window. Then follow the indicated dependency: PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, the OIDC provider or the cryptographic engine."},"393":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#validate-the-result-from-outside","content":"For PKI, check the certificate, the chain, OCSP or CRL with the same type of client production uses."},"394":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#minimal-evidence-collection","content":"Replace the placeholders with your real release, namespace and deployment."},"395":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#minimal-evidence-collection","content":"Also run the chart's connectivity test:"},"396":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#minimal-evidence-collection","content":"The test checks the health of CA, DMS Manager, Device Manager and VA, and verifies that the UI returns HTML. A passing test confirms basic connectivity, not a full issuance flow."},"397":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#minimal-evidence-collection","content":"The chart's services expose startup, readiness and liveness probes over /health. A pod can be running but receive no traffic if the readiness probe fails."},"398":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"If you receive a 401:"},"399":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"check that the UI's OIDC authority is reachable from the browser;"},"400":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"verify issuer, audience and expiration of the token;"},"401":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"confirm the Gateway can fetch the keys from the JWKS URI;"},"402":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"check that the provider's public and internal routes point to the same realm."},"403":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"If login succeeds but the APIs return 403:"},"404":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"inspect the token's real claims;"},"405":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"confirm they match an active principal;"},"406":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"review the policies granted to that principal;"},"407":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"verify that authz reaches PostgreSQL and its JWKS."},"408":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"On a fresh installation, confirm the migration Job finished. That Job creates schemas, migrates authz, preloads policies and provisions the principals defined in services.authz.bootstrap."},"409":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#everything-returns-403-or-5xx","content":"External authorization fails closed by default. If authz is unavailable, protected routes are blocked."},"410":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#everything-returns-403-or-5xx","content":"Locate the authz pod and Service."},"411":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#everything-returns-403-or-5xx","content":"Check /health, logs and its database connection."},"412":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#everything-returns-403-or-5xx","content":"Verify the DNS and port configured in externalAuthorization."},"413":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#everything-returns-403-or-5xx","content":"Check the check route is /v1/ext\\_authz/check."},"414":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#everything-returns-403-or-5xx","content":"Do not switch to failOpen: true as a permanent workaround: it would allow traffic without authorization during the outage."},"415":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#a-pod-is-not-ready","content":"Review kubectl describe pod first. Common causes are:"},"416":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#a-pod-is-not-ready","content":"wrong credentials or DNS for PostgreSQL or RabbitMQ;"},"417":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#a-pod-is-not-ready","content":"unbound persistent volume;"},"418":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#a-pod-is-not-ready","content":"inaccessible image or incorrect pull policy;"},"419":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#a-pod-is-not-ready","content":"invalid cryptographic engine configuration;"},"420":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#a-pod-is-not-ready","content":"CPU or memory limits set too low;"},"421":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#a-pod-is-not-ready","content":"an incomplete prior migration."},"422":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#a-pod-is-not-ready","content":"Generic values request 100 mCPU and 128 MiB and limit to 500 mCPU and 512 MiB. Tune per service when you see OOMKills, throttling or slow startups."},"423":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#a-pod-is-not-ready","content":"Filesystem-based KMS engines and VA local storage use exclusive-access volumes. Keep a single replica or migrate to shared backends before enabling autoscaling."},"424":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#events-are-not-arriving","content":"Domain and audit events depend on the bus publisher:"},"425":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#events-are-not-arriving","content":"verify it is enabled in the emitting service;"},"426":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#events-are-not-arriving","content":"check AMQP connectivity and credentials;"},"427":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#events-