nsuming pods from starting;"},"434":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#events-are-not-arriving","content":"after updating the CA or client certificate Secret, restart the consuming pods: the AMQP client loads certificates at startup."},"435":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#events-are-not-arriving","content":"See AMQP TLS (AMQPS) for the full configuration."},"436":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-61","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#events-are-not-arriving","content":"A consumer outage does not always prevent the main operation from completing. That is why you must monitor RabbitMQ and independently verify the persistence of audit logs."},"437":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-62","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#observability","content":"The chart can enable OpenTelemetry instrumentation. Traces are exported over OTLP HTTP and logs can be directed to a compatible endpoint, such as VictoriaLogs. Use a correlation identifier and the same time window to join Gateway, authz, service and dependency."},"438":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-63","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting#observability","content":"Before closing an incident, record:"},"439":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/deployment/troubleshooting-64","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/dep