ious identity."},"1482":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"ServerKeyGen"},"1483":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Disabled; the operational key is generated in the client."},"1484":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"CA Distribution"},"1485":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Include Enrollment CA enabled; Include Lamassu System CA disabled."},"1486":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Equal duration and window allow immediate renewal testing. These are evaluation values; size production settings according to connectivity and recovery times. Save, reread both authentication blocks and retain the DMS ID. If your console does not expose the independent block, configure and check the resource through the DMS API and DMS guide."},"1487":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#prepare-the-client-and-check-cacerts","content":"Place the four trust and bootstrap files in the new directory. Replace the URL with your installation's URL:"},"1488":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#prepare-the-client-and-check-cacerts","content":"The download must succeed and contain the expected enrollment root. Compare its fingerprint with `device-root.pem`. This check does not turn the response into initial trust or prove that you can issue."},"1489":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#enroll-the-device","content":"Generate a new key and CSR with the selected identifier:"},"1490":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#enroll-the-device","content":"Request the identity with the bootstrap credential and extract the certificate from the default response:"},"1491":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#enroll-the-device","content":"If curl fails, use Troubleshooting with the saved body. Do not convert it or repeat the request without querying inventory: a timeout or error can follow persisted issuance."},"1492":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#verify-the-obtained-identity","content":"Expect `device.crt: OK` and exit code 0 from `cmp`. Check the CN, serial, dates, Digital Signature and Client Authentication. The certificate must be a leaf: it must not declare `CA:TRUE` or Certificate Sign use. Check that its validity matches the one-hour profile."},"1493":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#verify-the-obtained-identity","content":"In Lamassu, open `est-device-001`. It must be created with the intended owning DMS, a current identity and the received certificate in its history. Compare the local serial with the slot; thresholds can show a renewal state rather than simply Active."},"1494":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#demonstrate-an-mtls-connection","content":"In a second terminal, enter the same directory and run `umask 077`. Create a local server certificate and start a test consumer. This server trusts `device-root.pem` and requires a valid client identity:"},"1495":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-56"