docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#comportamiento-tls","content":"Sin ellos, configura cert-manager con un emisor self-signed. Es adecuado para laboratorio, pero los clientes no confiarán en él hasta que distribuyas la CA. Usa Helm si necesitas un Issuer corporativo, un emisor ACME público o un Secret existente gestionado por otro sistema."},"183":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-105","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#credenciales-y-archivos-generados","content":"El modo no interactivo genera contraseñas aleatorias para los administradores de PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ y Keycloak. El acceso inicial a Lamassu es `lamassu` / `lamassu` y obliga a cambiar la contraseña en el primer uso."},"184":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-106","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#credenciales-y-archivos-generados","content":"Fastlane escribe `lamassu.yaml` en el directorio actual e incluye credenciales en él."},"185":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-107","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#credenciales-y-archivos-generados","content":"Protege el archivo de valores generado, guarda las credenciales en un almacén de secretos apropiado y no reutilices la configuración de identidad de evaluación en producción."},"186":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-108","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#verifica-la-instalación","content":"Abre `https://pki.example.com` e inicia sesión con el usuario inicial. Si el Gateway está programado pero la URL no es accesible, sigue las comprobaciones de Expón el Gateway."},"187":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"page","content":"Instala con Helm","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Despliegue","Kubernetes autogestionado"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm"},"188":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","content":"Prepara las dependencias, configura el chart de Lamassu y verifica un despliegue controlado en Kubernetes."},"189":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#instala-lamassu-con-helm","content":"Instala Lamassu con Helm"},"190":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"Antes de comenzar"},"191":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"1\\. Instala los requisitos del Gateway"},"192":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-