ployment/self-hosted/helm#instala-lamassu-con-helm","content":"Usa Helm cuando necesites control explícito sobre identidad, bases de datos, mensajería, certificados, almacenamiento y upgrades. Para un entorno de evaluación en el que el script pueda tomar esas decisiones, usa Fastlane."},"200":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"Prepara los servicios de plataforma que quedan deliberadamente fuera del chart de Lamassu:"},"201":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un clúster Kubernetes 1.24+ y Helm 3.2+"},"202":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un servidor PostgreSQL accesible y un rol autorizado para crear bases de datos y schemas"},"203":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un broker RabbitMQ accesible y sus credenciales"},"204":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un proveedor OIDC, normalmente Keycloak, con un realm/tenant y un cliente para Lamassu"},"205":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"Envoy Gateway 1.8+ y una `GatewayClass`"},"206":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"cert-manager 1.14+; para TLS de confianza, un emisor de confianza o un Secret TLS de Kubernetes"},"207":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"una StorageClass y un diseño de tráfico externo"},"208":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"El chart usa por defecto una `GatewayClass` llamada `eg`. Cambia `gateway.className` si tu equipo de plataforma utiliza otro nombre."},"209":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"Tú proporcionas el servidor PostgreSQL. El job de pre-install del chart se conecta con las credenciales indicadas, crea las bases de datos `pki`, `authz` y `wfx` y los schemas de los servicios, ejecuta las migraciones y aplica `services.authz.bootstrap`."},"210":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"El chart no tiene dependencias Helm que instalen PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, un proveedor OIDC, Envoy Gateway ni cert-manager."},"211":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"Instala o actualiza las CRD de Envoy Gateway antes de su controlador. Estos comandos usan la misma versión que el repositorio Helm de Lamassu:"},"212":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"Crea la `GatewayClass` predeterminada si todavía no existe. Guarda este manifiesto como `gateway-class.yaml`:"},"213":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"Instala cert-manager por separado antes de Lamassu. El chart actual renderiza sus recursos de issuer self-signed y certificado CA incluso cuando `tls.type: external` hace que el Gateway use un Secret TLS existente. Seleccionar TLS externo no elimina por tanto el requisito de cert-manager."},"214":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"Parte de los valores predeterminados del chart y sobrescribe los específicos del entorno. Este ejemplo supone que PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ y Keycloak son accesibles mediante DNS de Kubernetes y expone Keycloak en `/auth` a través del Gateway compartido:"},"215":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"No añadas `gateway.addresses` por defecto. Deja la asignación de dirección a la implementación del balanceador salvo que tu diseño de red requiera una VIP concreta en Kubernetes. La IP pública de un NAT o proxy upstream no corresponde a este valor."},"216":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"Si Keycloak es externo y ya tiene una URL accesible, apunta la configuración OIDC hacia él y omite la entrada `/auth` de `gateway.extraRouting`."},"217":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"Si tu archivo de valores aún contiene los ajustes heredados de validación JWT del Gateway — `auth.oidc.apiGateway.jwks`, `auth.authorization.rolesClaim` o `auth.authorization.roles.admin` — elimínalos. La guía de migración `charts/lamassu/CHANGELOG/3.8.0->4.0.0.md` documenta su eliminación sin alias de compatibilidad, y `values.schema.json` rechaza los bloques residuales en lugar de ignorarlos silenciosamente."},"218":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-con-un-secret-existente","content":"Crea un Secret con `tls.crt` y `tls.key` y referéncialo:"},"219":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-de-amqp-amqps","content":"`amqp.tls: true` selecciona AMQPS en todos los bloques de configuración del event bus. El puerto por defecto sigue siendo `5672` y no cambia automáticamente al habilitar TLS, así que define `amqp.port` con el listener TLS del broker, normalmente `5671`."},"220":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-de-amqp-amqps","content":"Sin un Secret de CA configurado, los clientes del event bus usan las CA de confianza del sistema. Para confiar en una CA privada, crea un Secret en el namespace del release con el certificado de la CA en formato PEM y define `amqp.ca.secretName` (y `amqp.ca.certificateKey` si la clave de datos no es `ca.crt`)."},"221":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-de-amqp-amqps","content":"Para brokers que exijan TLS mutuo, crea un Secret con el certificado de cliente y su clave privada y define `amqp.client.secretName` (con `amqp.client.certificateKey` y `amqp.client.privateKeyKey` si las claves de datos no son `tls.crt` y `tls.key`)."},"222":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-de-amqp-amqps","content":"El chart monta los Secrets configurados en modo de solo lectura en todas las cargas de trabajo que consumen AMQP: el certificado de la CA en `/etc/lamassu/amqp/ca` y el certificado y la clave de cliente en `/etc/lamassu/amqp/client`. La clave privada del cliente se monta con permisos restrictivos (`defaultMode: 0440`; el volumen de la CA usa `0444`)."},"223":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-de-amqp-amqps","content":"Ambas opciones de Secret exigen `amqp.tls: true`: `values.schema.json` rechaza un `secretName` no vacío cuando `tls` es false, rechaza claves desconocidas y rechaza nombres de clave de datos fuera de `^[A-Za-z0-9._-]+$`. El Secret referenciado debe existir en el namespace del release o los pods consumidores no llegan a arrancar."},"224":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-de-amqp-amqps","content":"El cliente AMQP carga los certificados al arrancar, así que reinicia los pods consumidores tras actualizar cualquiera de los dos Secrets. Cambiar cualquier valor de `amqp` reinicia las cargas de trabajo consumidoras mediante la anotación `checksum/config`, pero cambiar solo el contenido de un Secret no desencadena un rollout."},"225":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-de-amqp-amqps","content":"Según la guía de migración `charts/lamassu/CHANGELOG/3.8.0->4.0.0.md`: en 3.8.0 `amqp.tls` no se aplicaba y los clientes del event bus usaban AMQP en claro; desde 4.0.0, `amqp.tls: true` los cambia a AMQPS. Define `amqp.port` con el listener TLS del broker antes del upgrade, o usa `amqp.tls: false` para mantener AMQP en claro."},"226":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"No existe un superusuario implícito. Crea en el proveedor OIDC el rol o grupo esperado por `services.authz.bootstrap` y asígnalo al menos a un administrador antes de exponer Lamassu."},"227":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"El job de pre-install y pre-upgrade aplica el bootstrap de forma idempotente: conserva los principales existentes y añade los grants que falten."},"228":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Prueba una identidad autorizada y otra denegada. Si ningún token coincide con un principal activo del bootstrap, nadie podrá administrar la PKI."},"229":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Consulta Control de acceso para conocer el modelo de principales y políticas."},"230":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#3-instala-lamassu","content":"Para instalar un checkout local:"},"231":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#4-verifica-el-despliegue","content":"El Gateway debe mostrar `PROGRAMMED=True`. Si está programado pero no tiene una dirección utilizable, continúa con Expón el Gateway."},"232":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#4-verifica-el-despliegue","content":"El test de Helm comprueba los endpoints de salud de CA, DMS Manager, Device Manager y VA, y verifica la respuesta de la UI."},"233":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"Antes de pasar a producción, revisa:"},"234":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"backup y recuperación de PostgreSQL y volúmenes persistentes"},"235":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"un motor KMS de producción; el motor filesystem predeterminado no ofrece alta disponibilidad"},"236":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"almacenamiento compartido para VA antes de aumentar sus réplicas"},"237":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"roles OIDC gestionados y eliminación de credenciales de evaluación"},"238":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"un emisor TLS de confianza o un certificado gestionado externamente"},"239":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"recursos, réplicas, autoscaling, disruption budgets y placement"},"240":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"SMTP, observabilidad y entrega de alertas"},"241":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"las notas de migración de `charts/lamassu/CHANGELOG/` antes de cada upgrade"},"242":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"La referencia completa de valores se mantiene en `charts/lamassu/VALUES.md` dentro del repositorio Helm."},"243":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"page","content":"Expón el Gateway","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Despliegue","Kubernetes autogestionado"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking"},"244":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","content":"Elige cómo llegan los clientes a Lamassu, cuándo definir gateway.addresses y cómo diseñar varios Gateways."},"245":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#expón-el-gateway-de-lamassu","content":"Expón el Gateway de Lamassu"},"246":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"¿Necesitas `gateway.addresses`?"},"247":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#diseño-recomendado-para-un-solo-nodo","content":"Diseño recomendado para un solo nodo"},"248":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"K3s"},"249":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#bare-metal-con-metallb-o-kube-vip","content":"Bare metal con MetalLB o kube-vip"},"250":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#proxy-externo-nat-o-vpn","content":"Proxy externo, NAT o VPN"},"251":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"¿Qué ocurre si necesitas tres Gateways?"},"252":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Guía de decisión"},"253":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"Verifica la ruta de tráfico"},"254":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#expón-el-gateway-de-lamassu","content":"El chart de Lamassu crea un Gateway compartido con listeners HTTP y HTTPS. Envoy Gateway crea normalmente un deployment de proxy dedicado y un Service `LoadBalancer`."},"255":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#expón-el-gateway-de-lamassu","content":"La accesibilidad externa depende de toda la ruta. Un recurso `Gateway` no configura por sí mismo el router, firewall, DNS, balanceador cloud ni NAT upstream."},"256":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"Normalmente no. Si lo omites, el controlador del Gateway y la implementación del balanceador pueden asignar una dirección y publicarla en `Gateway.status.addresses` y en el estado del Service generado."},"257":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"Defínelo únicamente cuando:"},"258":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"tu balanceador cloud o bare metal permite solicitar una dirección concreta"},"259":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"esa dirección está asignada a este Gateway"},"260":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"la red