e `LoadBalancer` generado sea accesible desde tu red."},"361":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Usa un único Gateway de Lamassu en los puertos 80 y 443 y deja que sus HTTPRoutes distribuyan el tráfico a todos los servicios. Proporciona a ese Gateway un único endpoint accesible mediante el balanceador del clúster, o reenvía tráfico desde un proxy externo o un dispositivo NAT. No necesitas un Gateway por servicio."},"362":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#cómo-encaja-el-despliegue","content":"El chart crea un `Gateway` compartido por cada release de Helm. Todos los recursos `HTTPRoute` gestionados por el chart se conectan a él. Envoy Gateway provisiona el data plane del proxy y un Service `LoadBalancer` de Kubernetes para ese Gateway."},"363":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#cómo-encaja-el-despliegue","content":"El valor `gateway.addresses` solo solicita una dirección al controlador del Gateway. No hace que una IP sea enrutable, abre un firewall, configura DNS ni crea NAT. Consulta Expón el Gateway antes de definirlo."},"364":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"Kubernetes 1.24 o posterior"},"365":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"Helm 3.2 o posterior"},"366":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"Envoy Gateway 1.8 o posterior y una `GatewayClass`"},"367":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"cert-manager 1.14 o posterior; el chart actual renderiza recursos issuer y certificate de cert-manager"},"368":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"almacenamiento persistente adecuado para la configuración elegida de PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, VA y KMS"},"369":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"una implementación de balanceador o alguna otra ruta deliberada desde los clientes hasta el Gateway"},"370":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"Los despliegues KMS que usan el sidecar PKCS#11 nativo requieren Kubernetes 1.29 o posterior."},"371":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-la-siguiente-página","content":"<Card title=\"Instala con Helm\" description=\"Prepara dependencias, configura valores, instala y verifica un despliegue controlado.\" href=\"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/helm\" />"},"372":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-la-siguiente-página","content":"<Card title=\"Expón el Gateway\" description=\"Elige un diseño de tráfico externo, comprende gateway.addresses y gestiona varios Gateways.\" href=\"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/networking\" />"},"373":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-la-siguiente-página","content":"<Card title=\"Usa Fastlane\" description=\"Arranca un entorno completo de evaluación o laboratorio con un script.\" href=\"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane\" />"},"374":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"Resolución de problemas de despliegue","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Despliegue","Operación"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting"},"375":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","content":"Diagnostica acceso, salud de los servicios y dependencias de infraestructura."},"376":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#secuencia-de-diagnóstico","content":"Secuencia de diagnóstico"},"377":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#reproduce-una-sola-operación","content":"Reproduce una sola operación"},"378":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#separa-cliente-gateway-y-servicio","content":"Separa cliente, Gateway y servicio"},"379":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#revisa-el-estado-de-kubernetes","content":"Revisa el estado de Kubernetes"},"380":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#consulta-el-servicio-afectado","content":"Consulta el servicio afectado"},"381":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#valida-el-resultado-desde-fuera","content":"Valida el resultado desde fuera"},"382":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Recogida mínima de evidencias"},"383":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"No puedo iniciar sesión"},"384":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Todo devuelve 403 o 5xx"},"385":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Un pod no está Ready"},"386":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"Los eventos no llegan"},"387":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"Observabilidad"},"388":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","content":"Empieza por localizar la capa que falla. Una respuesta del Gateway y un pod no preparado requieren evidencias distintas. Para emisión rechazada o resultados de validación, consulta el diagnóstico PKI; para enrolamiento, el diagnóstico EST."},"389":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#reproduce-una-sola-operación","content":"Anota hora en UTC, usuario o principal, recurso, endpoint y resultado. Evita repetir una acción destructiva como revocación o eliminación."},"390":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#separa-cliente-gateway-y-servicio","content":"Comprueba el código HTTP. Un 401 apunta a autenticación; un 403, a autorización; un 404, a ruta o recurso; un 5xx, al servicio o una dependencia."},"391":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#revisa-el-estado-de-kubernetes","content":"Localiza pods no preparados, reinicios, eventos recientes y el estado del release."},"392":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#consulta-el-servicio-afectado","content":"Revisa su endpoint /health y sus logs en la misma ventana temporal. Después sigue la dependencia indicada: PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, proveedor OIDC o motor criptográfico."},"393":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#valida-el-resultado-desde-fuera","content":"Para PKI, comprueba el certificado, la cadena, OCSP o CRL con el mismo tipo de cliente que utiliza producción."},"394":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Sustituye los marcadores por tu release, namespace y deployment reales."},"395":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Ejecuta también la prueba de conectividad del chart:"},"396":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"El test consulta la salud de CA, DMS Manager, Device Manager y VA, y comprueba que la UI devuelve HTML. Un test correcto confirma conectividad básica, no un flujo completo de emisión."},"397":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Los servicios del chart exponen sondas de inicio, disponibilidad y vida sobre /health. Un pod puede estar ejecutándose pero no recibir tráfico si la readiness probe falla."},"398":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"Si recibes un 401:"},"399":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"comprueba que la autoridad OIDC de la UI sea accesible desde el navegador;"},"400":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"verifica emisor, audiencia y expiración del token;"},"401":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"confirma que el Gateway puede obtener las claves de la URI JWKS;"},"402":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"revisa que la ruta pública e interna del proveedor apunten al mismo realm."},"403":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"Si el login termina pero las APIs devuelven 403:"},"404":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"inspecciona los claims reales del token;"},"405":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"confirma que coinciden con un principal activo;"},"406":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"revisa las políticas concedidas al principal;"},"407":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"verifica que authz alcanza PostgreSQL y su JWKS."},"408":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"En una instalación nueva, confirma que el Job de migración terminó. Ese Job crea esquemas, migra authz, precarga políticas y provisiona los principales definidos en services.authz.bootstrap."},"409":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"La autorización externa falla cerrada por defecto. Si authz no está disponible, las rutas protegidas se bloquean."},"410":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Localiza el pod y Service de authz."},"411":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Comprueba /health, logs y conexión a su base de datos