-certificate-authority","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Si el resultado falla"},"2234":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#siguiente-paso","content":"Siguiente paso"},"2235":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","content":"Crearás una autoridad raíz con una clave nueva custodiada por un motor de Lamassu. Al terminar tendrás una CA activa y su certificado público en `ca.pem`, preparado para verificar la emisión del siguiente recorrido."},"2236":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"Acceso a la consola y permisos para crear claves y autoridades."},"2237":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un motor criptográfico disponible que admita el algoritmo elegido."},"2238":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-42